{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/names/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长为周围友军持续提供治疗与增益的辅助，并可随战斗推进而不断成长。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Support who can heal and imbue buffs to nearby allies continuously."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","又有谁需要提提神了？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Who else needs a little pick-me-up?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","药劲上来了，价格也得提一提！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The medicine's more potent, so the price needs to match."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","哎哟，快、快多撒点儿香料！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ah! Quick! More herbs!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","水……兑得太多了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Should've... used... some of the real stuff."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","就说了，我们不卖假货！！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Just saying, we don't sell ripoffs."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","香料和药水准备好了吗？客人上门了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Are the potions ready? We got customers coming!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","呜呜，没事吧？小心点！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hey! You alright? Be more careful!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","你看看，不對勁，沒有，沒有，小心點，別送蟹了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","*Sniffing* Stay alert! No one's following, right? Be careful, and don't let your guard down."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","薰香强壮身心，藥水保之百病。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Herbs to fortify the body and mind! Potions to cure all ailments!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","诶哟，这东西一定很值钱吧！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Woah! This must be worth a ton!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","拿到就算赚到。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Receiving this is like hitting the gift jackpot!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","荒土药师"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Wasteland Apothecary"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","狡兔三窟，制药和逃命都要顺手才行。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Mastering the art of medicine preparation and honing escape skills are both essential for survival."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","冬裘新庆"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Frosted Elegance"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","生活再不易，也要给孩子们装点些节日氛围不是？"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","You can't skimp on festive decorations for the children."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Velvet Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这味道，够劲！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This really hits the spot!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","再兑点儿水进去……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Let me add more water..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","套餐有优惠没有？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Is there a discount for the set meal?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有人要御寒药剂吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Anyone need a cold-resistant elixir?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节特别折扣！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Special Winter Carnival discount! Grab it before it's gone!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这灯笼真吉利啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Meerky, don't get too close to the fire."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","特制烟花降价啦！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Special fireworks, on sale!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","阿熏给自己定下规矩，不骗生活比自己更辛苦的人。但很少遇到。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Smokey made it a rule not to cheat anyone whose life is worse than his own. Interestingly enough, this rule rarely applies."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","阿熏喜欢给蒙蒙讲故事。蒙蒙以为都是假的，其实却不然。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Smokey enjoys telling stories to Meerky, who thinks of them as nothing more than tall tales. However, that may not be the case..."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会把最好的食物留给蒙蒙。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Smokey always saves the best food for Meerky."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿熏骗人熟练，道歉更熟练，完成下跪这一动作仅需一秒。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","The only thing Smokey does better than lying is begging for mercy. He can drop to his knees in less than a second if the occasion calls for it."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","其实也有人看他带着孩子可怜，请阿熏帮忙，但阿熏稳定不下来。这样的生活已成习惯。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","After seeing him raise Meerky on his own, many people often take pity on Smokey and offer their help. He refuses every time, saying that the two of them have long since grown accustomed to living like this."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会喝酒，但遇到蒙蒙后戒了。影响不好，也没闲钱。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Smokey used to be a heavy drinker, but he quit after meeting Meerky. He claims that drinking does him no favors and that money is too tight for that sort of thing now."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","蒙蒙知道阿熏和自己没有血缘关系。但它知道谁对自己最好。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Meerky knows that Smokey is not related to him by blood but also knows that this older Mauler cares just the same."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","如果有开张的日子，阿熏会给蒙蒙一笔零花钱，这些钱都被蒙蒙存起来。数目可观。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Whenever he gets paid, Smokey always makes sure to give Meerky some spending money, which he has saved to a sizeable amount."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会用树叶吹乐曲。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Smokey can play music by blowing into leaves. He always plays \"Rock-a-bye Meerky\" during bedtime."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿熏最喜欢躺在地上晒太阳，肚子暖暖的。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Smokey loves lying around, basking in the sun. It keeps his belly warm. He proclaims, \"Abdominal sunning is good for wellness, sleep, and longevity. At least that's what I heard from some gurus. Meerky doesn't believe in it.\""],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","谁说不存在所谓的畅销药剂？很多人根本就不识货。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Who said these highly sought-after potions didn't exist? Lots of folks just don't know quality when they see it."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","阿熏"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Smokey"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","累了？尝尝这个？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Feeling tired? Try this!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411160.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411160.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿熏"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Smokey"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Oh no, what to do with these herbs?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Odie & Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这味道，够劲！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","This really hits the spot!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415074.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415074.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","套餐有优惠没有？"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Is there a discount for the set meal?"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415075.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415075.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","有人要御寒药剂吗？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Anyone need a cold-resistant elixir?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415383.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415383.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节特别折扣！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Special Winter Carnival discount! Grab it before it's gone!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415384.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415384.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","戴蒙又跑到哪里去了？这孩子，真让人担心……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Where has Daimon gone this time? That boy... he's always a cause for concern."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415487.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415487.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","雪米拉 & 阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Shemira & Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","这灯笼真吉利啊！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Meerky, don't get too close to the fire."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415555.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415555.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","特制烟花降价啦！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Special fireworks, on sale!"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415556.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415556.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Smokey & Meerky"]]}